    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The princess is missing!</strong><br><br>Can you find her while proving you're a true hero along the way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692730/extras/7a206e467e6c8effd45e29386e3e771d.poster.avif?t=1745862153\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692730/extras/7a206e467e6c8effd45e29386e3e771d.webm?t=1745862153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692730/extras/7a206e467e6c8effd45e29386e3e771d.mp4?t=1745862153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this text-based adventure inspired by the old greats like King's Quest and Monkey Island, you'll discover a gloomy and desperate realm in need of saving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692730/extras/90b2f027d5c806f53bdad51c1fa3cc43.poster.avif?t=1745862153\" width=800 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692730/extras/90b2f027d5c806f53bdad51c1fa3cc43.webm?t=1745862153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692730/extras/90b2f027d5c806f53bdad51c1fa3cc43.mp4?t=1745862153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make mistakes, master puzzles, fail</strong> - and come out the other side wiser and ready to try again. Your path will be a punishing one. Are you prepared?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The princess is missing!</strong><br><br>Can you find her while proving you're a true hero along the way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692730/extras/7a206e467e6c8effd45e29386e3e771d.poster.avif?t=1745862153\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692730/extras/7a206e467e6c8effd45e29386e3e771d.webm?t=1745862153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692730/extras/7a206e467e6c8effd45e29386e3e771d.mp4?t=1745862153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this text-based adventure inspired by the old greats like King's Quest and Monkey Island, you'll discover a gloomy and desperate realm in need of saving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692730/extras/90b2f027d5c806f53bdad51c1fa3cc43.poster.avif?t=1745862153\" width=800 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692730/extras/90b2f027d5c806f53bdad51c1fa3cc43.webm?t=1745862153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692730/extras/90b2f027d5c806f53bdad51c1fa3cc43.mp4?t=1745862153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make mistakes, master puzzles, fail</strong> - and come out the other side wiser and ready to try again. Your path will be a punishing one. Are you prepared?</p>",
